# Project agent instructions

For Embedded C, STM32, GD32, bare-metal, HAL/SPL/CMSIS, or RTOS firmware tasks, use the `embedded-c-firmware-engineering` skill when relevant.

Before editing firmware:
- inspect the existing architecture and build system
- preserve project-specific HAL/SPL/RTOS conventions
- prefer the smallest safe change
- run relevant build/static-analysis checks after modifications when available
